Z||000000||fldevel||11-10-2000||10:23 AM||||ok ive replaced vaccume lines,MAP senser,IAC,what else could it be ?? car runs great for about 5 minutes ..then engine light comes on and i step on the gas and the car dies ... and is it possible to fix it before the car show tomorrow  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> thanks for the space all ||||reg||1
